    "text": "A body weighing $13 \\mathrm{~kg}$ is suspended by two strings $5 \\mathrm{~m}$ and $12 \\mathrm{~m}$ long, their other ends being fastened to the extremities of a rod $13 \\mathrm{~m}$ long. If the rod be so held that the body hangs immediately below the middle point. The tensions in the strings are"
